WEBVTT

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:02.180
What is this place?

00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:05.650
Our duel academy, the You Show School.

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:07.350
You Show School?!

00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:09.110
This way.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.460
A-Are you...

00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:26.300
The Aquaria Project.

00:00:27.030 --> 00:00:32.080
In their plan to create an ideal world, 
the Fusion Dimension's Academia

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:37.400
has driven Heartland City, in the Xyz 
Dimension, to the brink of obliteration.

00:02:11.210 --> 00:02:15.980
The HEROs Named "D"

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:17.830
No way.

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:21.660
Why?

00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:24.820
Are you Yuzu?

00:02:27.350 --> 00:02:30.310
It is true. It really is true.

00:02:34.900 --> 00:02:36.660
Mr. Sakaki!

00:02:37.560 --> 00:02:39.740
Everyone's been so worried!

00:02:40.140 --> 00:02:43.820
Yuya, Yoko, my father...

00:02:43.820 --> 00:02:46.010
Okay, I suppose they would be.

00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:49.380
I'm sorry I worried you.

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:55.150
But what are you doing here?

00:02:57.120 --> 00:02:59.550
I've been through a great deal, as well.

00:02:59.550 --> 00:03:02.360
Before I came here, I was 
in the Xyz Dimension.

00:03:02.730 --> 00:03:04.360
The Xyz Dimension?

00:03:04.360 --> 00:03:07.970
But the Xyz Dimension was 
invaded by Academia!

00:03:08.740 --> 00:03:11.260
You seem to know quite a lot, too.

00:03:11.260 --> 00:03:16.360
When the invasion began, 
I was in the Xyz Dimension.

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:19.510
Then a man sent me here.

00:03:20.120 --> 00:03:21.630
A man?

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:22.710
Yes.

00:03:23.080 --> 00:03:24.520
His name was...

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:28.380
It's late, it's late, it's late!

00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:33.480
By my initial reckoning, the 
Aquaria Project in the Xyz Dimension

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:37.860
is 3 days, 18 hours, 43 minutes, 
and 58 seconds behind schedule...

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:40.830
No, 44 minutes behind schedule!

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:45.320
At this rate, the Professor will 
punish me for my failure...

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:49.000
We must finish turning all the 
citizens into cards at once.

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:50.540
Do you hear me?!

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:52.280
You, and you, and you!

00:03:52.280 --> 00:03:53.240
Yes, sir!

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:54.210
Good grief.

00:03:54.210 --> 00:03:56.910
I'm here, worrying my head off,

00:03:56.910 --> 00:04:02.480
while the commander, who should take 
responsibility, is missing once again!

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:04.260
Where has he gone?!

00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:17.140
Where did he go?

00:04:17.640 --> 00:04:19.110
That man...

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:25.150
One day, he disappeared without warning.

00:04:25.150 --> 00:04:27.350
He abandoned us and ran away!

00:04:28.640 --> 00:04:30.280
That isn't true!

00:04:30.280 --> 00:04:36.320
Dad would never abandon people that 
Academia's armies were attacking.

00:04:37.030 --> 00:04:38.020
Hey, Ute...

00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:41.030
Did you really know about this?

00:04:41.490 --> 00:04:44.430
That Dad came to Heartland?

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:46.400
No, I didn't know that.

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:49.370
Liar! Back then, you said...

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:53.000
Make people smile by dueling.

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:56.960
Those were my father's words.

00:04:56.960 --> 00:04:59.750
So you must have met my father—

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:01.350
No, I didn't.

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:04.320
Ruri said that...

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:06.820
Before Academia took her.

00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:24.310
This is wrong.

00:05:25.330 --> 00:05:27.910
Duels aren't tools of war!

00:05:28.290 --> 00:05:33.260
Duels should bring smiles to everyone... 
to these children's future.

00:05:33.260 --> 00:05:34.150
Isn't that right?

00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:41.320
Thinking back, Sayaka may have exposed her

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:43.510
to Yusyo Sakaki's teachings.

00:05:44.770 --> 00:05:49.360
Since Sayaka and the rest were educated 
at Yusyo Sakaki's Clover Branch.

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:50.840
I see.

00:05:50.840 --> 00:05:53.570
And that's how you knew my father's words.

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:57.270
Yes. The words Ruri taught me.

00:06:00.820 --> 00:06:03.770
Can I talk to you this way because

00:06:03.770 --> 00:06:06.010
we're in the Xyz Dimension?

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:11.220
When you were fighting that 
Academia soldier, Barrett,

00:06:11.220 --> 00:06:14.190
I heard a voice, rising from 
the depths of my heart.

00:06:17.220 --> 00:06:20.970
At that time, our four dragons 
called to each other.

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:24.100
Like they were trying to become one.

00:06:24.970 --> 00:06:28.800
Yeah, I remember the uncomfortable 
sensation then, too.

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:31.320
Like my mind and body

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:35.400
were being taken over by something unknown.

00:06:35.400 --> 00:06:40.280
Could the reason we can 
talk be related to that?

00:06:41.220 --> 00:06:46.650
And Dark Rebellion's will could also be the 
reason I'm within you, in the first place.

00:06:47.970 --> 00:06:49.410
What are you talking about?

00:06:49.410 --> 00:06:51.760
What are you doing here?

00:06:54.830 --> 00:06:58.160
Um, well, I'm searching for my father—

00:06:59.300 --> 00:07:00.860
You were separated?

00:07:00.860 --> 00:07:02.030
And the name?

00:07:02.870 --> 00:07:04.810
Your father's name.

00:07:04.810 --> 00:07:07.080
I might be able to find him.

00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:09.240
Um, who are you?

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:10.210
Speak!

00:07:13.170 --> 00:07:15.110
My father's name is Yusyo Sakaki—

00:07:15.110 --> 00:07:15.800
What?

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:18.140
Sakaki...

00:07:18.840 --> 00:07:22.390
You are Yusyo Sakaki's son?

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:26.360
Do you know my dad?

00:07:26.640 --> 00:07:27.860
Yes...

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:30.060
I could never forget him!

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:34.600
Here, too... There are people 
who hate my father.

00:07:35.030 --> 00:07:36.770
This is a good chance.

00:07:37.270 --> 00:07:40.330
If you are really Yusyo Sakaki's son,

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:43.710
I shall use you as bait to lure him out!

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:45.210
That disk!

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:46.910
It's from Academia!

00:07:47.510 --> 00:07:50.880
You fought my father? When? Where?

00:07:50.880 --> 00:07:52.380
None of your business.

00:07:52.380 --> 00:07:53.630
Tell me...

00:07:53.630 --> 00:07:54.850
What happened to my father?!

00:07:54.850 --> 00:07:56.050
Stop wasting your breath!

00:08:02.660 --> 00:08:05.230
Field Spell Crossover.

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:12.330
I'll find out what happened 
between him and my dad.

00:08:12.870 --> 00:08:13.880
Duel!

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:16.700
I'll go first!

00:08:16.700 --> 00:08:19.880
I summon Performapal Flip Hippo!

00:08:26.210 --> 00:08:27.900
Performapal...

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:30.640
When I succeed in summoning this card,

00:08:30.640 --> 00:08:33.580
I can summon one Performapal 
from my hand.

00:08:33.580 --> 00:08:35.820
Come out, Hip Hippo!

00:08:37.960 --> 00:08:43.130
Then, using Flip Hippo's effect, 
I switch both to defense position!

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:48.380
I then set one card and end my turn!

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:51.910
Okay, now I can see what he does.

00:08:52.410 --> 00:08:55.130
Don't forget that he's from Academia. 
Don't lower your guard.

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:59.580
I know. But I need to know where Dad is.

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:03.050
To do that, I must communicate with him!

00:09:03.370 --> 00:09:05.900
Using Performapals...

00:09:05.900 --> 00:09:10.350
I suppose you really must 
be Yusyo Sakaki's son.

00:09:10.350 --> 00:09:13.060
Then, I shall engage you with all I have.

00:09:13.060 --> 00:09:15.150
My turn! Draw!

00:09:15.960 --> 00:09:19.500
I summon Destiny HERO — Drilldark!

00:09:23.470 --> 00:09:26.280
On a turn when I summon a D-HERO,

00:09:26.280 --> 00:09:29.130
I can activate my spell card D-Pressure,

00:09:29.370 --> 00:09:34.700
and Special Summon one D-HERO of equal 
or fewer attack points than that monster.

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:37.860
Come on, another one!

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:46.860
When Drilldark attacks a defense-position 
monster, it deals piercing damage.

00:09:46.860 --> 00:09:49.330
Go, Drilldarks! Go fight!

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:09.820
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:12.980
Are you okay, Yuya?

00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:17.270
He's really trying to beat you.

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:18.960
Even still,

00:10:19.450 --> 00:10:22.430
I believe I can communicate with my duel!

00:10:22.430 --> 00:10:24.070
My turn!

00:10:26.670 --> 00:10:29.380
I activate my spell card Smile World!

00:10:30.840 --> 00:10:31.830
What?

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:33.750
Until my End Phase,

00:10:33.750 --> 00:10:36.720
the attack points of all monsters on the field

00:10:36.720 --> 00:10:39.200
increases by their number times 100!

00:10:43.680 --> 00:10:46.170
Smile World...

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:57.620
When there are no monsters on my field and 
one of your monster's attack points increase,

00:10:57.620 --> 00:11:00.330
I can activate my trap card Smile Potion!

00:11:01.970 --> 00:11:05.780
Its effect lets me draw two cards!

00:11:05.780 --> 00:11:09.750
I activate my set card D-Fusion!

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:13.660
This trap can only be activated 
during your turn.

00:11:13.660 --> 00:11:17.980
Its effect lets me send two 
Drilldarks to my graveyard,

00:11:17.980 --> 00:11:19.840
to Fusion Summon!

00:11:20.850 --> 00:11:22.160
Watch out, Yuya!

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:23.060
Yeah.

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:27.070
Two heroes who pierce the 
bedrock of destiny,

00:11:27.070 --> 00:11:30.440
become one now, and reign 
over a future of darkness!

00:11:30.440 --> 00:11:32.170
Fusion Summon!

00:11:32.490 --> 00:11:36.570
Come on, Destiny HERO — Dystopia!

00:11:41.750 --> 00:11:42.750
Damn!

00:11:43.210 --> 00:11:45.180
Dystopia's effect...

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:49.190
The attack points of one Drilldark, used as 
a component in Dystopia's summoning,

00:11:49.190 --> 00:11:50.420
are dealt as damage to you.

00:11:50.420 --> 00:11:52.160
Squeeze Palm!

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:04.240
Now that he's beaten you this badly, 
you still think you can talk?

00:12:04.720 --> 00:12:06.650
Yeah... I'll talk.

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:09.710
We can communicate through a duel!

00:12:09.710 --> 00:12:14.050
He's a member of Academia, those who 
destroyed my hometown!

00:12:14.050 --> 00:12:15.680
But he knows my father!

00:12:16.610 --> 00:12:19.640
I want to know where my dad went.

00:12:20.550 --> 00:12:25.640
If I can't talk to him here, I might 
never find another clue!

00:12:26.460 --> 00:12:28.990
He hates Yusyo Sakaki.

00:12:28.990 --> 00:12:29.590
Thus...

00:12:30.260 --> 00:12:33.800
Not even Yusyo Sakaki 
could make him smile!

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:38.110
Having returned to Heartland 
and seen the ruins

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:40.740
the city has been reduced to, I've realized...

00:12:41.200 --> 00:12:44.760
Bringing smiles with duels... 
I think that's the ideal.

00:12:44.760 --> 00:12:47.210
But we can only do that

00:12:47.680 --> 00:12:49.980
after we've defeated Academia!

00:12:49.980 --> 00:12:51.050
Ute!

00:12:55.480 --> 00:12:58.970
I set the Pendulum Scale with 
Scale 3 Performapal Seal Eel

00:12:58.970 --> 00:13:03.910
and Scale 5 Performapal Changeraffe!

00:13:06.480 --> 00:13:10.100
Now I can summon Level 4 
monsters simultaneously!

00:13:10.490 --> 00:13:13.070
Swing, my soul's pendulum!

00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:16.040
Draw a shining arc in the sky!

00:13:16.040 --> 00:13:17.780
Pendulum Summon!

00:13:17.780 --> 00:13:20.810
Appear, my monsters!

00:13:22.350 --> 00:13:23.480
Pendulum?

00:13:23.920 --> 00:13:26.450
Come out, Performapal Skeeter Skimmer!

00:13:26.940 --> 00:13:29.920
And Level 4 Helpprincess!

00:13:30.370 --> 00:13:33.540
This is... Pendulum Summon?

00:13:34.220 --> 00:13:37.360
I activate Seal Eel's Pendulum Effect!

00:13:38.120 --> 00:13:41.300
I negate Dystopia's effect this turn,

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:44.300
and recover life equal to its attack points!

00:13:45.490 --> 00:13:50.510
Then, I Overlay Level 4 Skeeter 
Skimmer and Helpprincess!

00:13:54.010 --> 00:13:55.750
From the black darkness,

00:13:55.750 --> 00:13:59.750
the fangs of rebellion that fight against 
the powers of stupidity descend!

00:14:00.420 --> 00:14:01.720
Xyz Summon!

00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:07.890
Appear, Rank 4 Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:14:09.850 --> 00:14:14.730
I use one of Dark Rebellion Xyz 
Dragon's Overlay Units...

00:14:14.730 --> 00:14:18.520
Until my End Phase, I halve 
Dystopia's attack points

00:14:18.520 --> 00:14:23.850
and increase Dark Rebellion's attack 
points by the same amount!

00:14:23.850 --> 00:14:25.930
Treason Discharge!

00:14:27.440 --> 00:14:31.320
If Dystopia's effect hadn't been sealed...

00:14:31.320 --> 00:14:35.290
And I use its other Overlay Unit.

00:14:35.700 --> 00:14:37.590
Treason Discharge!

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:43.770
Battle!

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:47.630
Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon attacks Dystopia!

00:14:47.630 --> 00:14:50.670
Lightning Disobey of Rebellion!

00:14:50.670 --> 00:14:53.610
I use trap card D-Fusion's effect

00:14:53.610 --> 00:14:57.220
to prevent a Special Summoned 
monster's destruction this turn!

00:14:58.780 --> 00:15:00.980
But you take the damage!

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:07.870
I now end my turn.

00:15:07.870 --> 00:15:12.830
In that instant, Dark Rebellion Xyz 
Dragon's monster effect ends,

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:16.030
and Seal Eel's Pendulum Effect ends, too.

00:15:22.380 --> 00:15:27.880
Yusyo Sakaki's son can use Xyz Summon?

00:15:27.880 --> 00:15:31.840
I'm surprised since he said he 
came from another dimension.

00:15:31.840 --> 00:15:33.950
But I don't care about that...

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:38.600
If you are Yusyo Sakaki's son, 
I just have to defeat you.

00:15:38.600 --> 00:15:40.650
My turn! Draw!

00:15:41.260 --> 00:15:45.860
Dystopia attacks Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:15:46.460 --> 00:15:48.060
Dystopia Blow!

00:15:56.880 --> 00:16:00.240
I activate Performapal Changeraffe's 
Pendulum Effect!

00:16:00.240 --> 00:16:04.670
By destroying itself, it can Special 
Summon the Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon

00:16:04.670 --> 00:16:06.730
that was destroyed by battle,
 in attack position!

00:16:07.640 --> 00:16:10.860
That Xyz Monster again? You never learn.

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:13.920
When my opponent Special 
Summons during battle,

00:16:14.250 --> 00:16:17.150
I can banish one D-HERO from my graveyard,

00:16:17.150 --> 00:16:20.540
to activate my trap card D-Doom Dance!

00:16:21.420 --> 00:16:25.040
Dark Rebellion's attack points are reduced

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:27.850
by the banished Drilldark's attack points!

00:16:30.970 --> 00:16:36.910
This turn, monsters targeted by this effect 
can be attacked twice by a D-HERO.

00:16:36.910 --> 00:16:40.080
Go! Attack, Dystopia!

00:16:40.590 --> 00:16:42.660
Dystopia Blow!

00:16:44.360 --> 00:16:48.020
Monsters Special Summoned 
with Changeraffe's effect

00:16:48.300 --> 00:16:50.090
can't be destroyed this turn!

00:16:50.490 --> 00:16:52.460
But you don't avoid the damage!

00:16:57.450 --> 00:17:02.660
I activate my Continuous Spell D-Faceoff 
from my hand and end my turn.

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:08.710
As long as you use Xyz Monsters, 
you cannot possibly beat me.

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:12.060
During each of our End Phases,

00:17:12.060 --> 00:17:14.840
this card tallies the levels of 
our respective monsters.

00:17:14.840 --> 00:17:17.100
If my side's total is higher,

00:17:17.100 --> 00:17:23.490
one D-HERO's attack points increase 
by the difference times 100.

00:17:23.790 --> 00:17:26.070
The total of the levels? But...

00:17:26.610 --> 00:17:29.190
Xyz Monsters don't have a level.

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:32.160
Yes... The answer is clear.

00:17:32.890 --> 00:17:35.970
My Dystopia is Level 8.

00:17:35.970 --> 00:17:39.610
Your Dark Rebellion Xyz 
Dragon has no level...

00:17:39.610 --> 00:17:41.370
In other words, the difference is 8.

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:44.640
Dystopia's attack points increase by 800.

00:17:45.210 --> 00:17:48.350
In that instant, Dystopia's effect activates!

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:53.390
When its attack points change, 
I destroy one card on the field!

00:17:53.390 --> 00:17:57.100
I destroy that eyesore, Performapal Seal Eel.

00:17:57.100 --> 00:17:58.840
Noble Justice!

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:07.430
Now, Dystopia's effect cannot be negated.

00:18:07.870 --> 00:18:10.780
And you will also take damage.

00:18:10.780 --> 00:18:16.170
Though only by the amount that 
D-Faceoff increased its attack points.

00:18:16.170 --> 00:18:18.680
In other words, 800 points!

00:18:22.440 --> 00:18:24.820
I activate my Action Spell Acceleration!

00:18:25.400 --> 00:18:27.280
I reduce effect damage to 0!

00:18:27.280 --> 00:18:28.720
What?

00:18:28.720 --> 00:18:30.410
I see.

00:18:30.410 --> 00:18:32.310
But you cannot beat me.

00:18:32.720 --> 00:18:36.090
Because Continuous Spell D-Faceoff

00:18:36.090 --> 00:18:39.720
will deal damage to you in the End Phase!

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:40.660
He'll pay.

00:18:42.040 --> 00:18:45.430
This must be how he took out 
so many of my allies.

00:18:46.150 --> 00:18:49.310
So many Resistance duelists!

00:18:49.310 --> 00:18:50.650
Ute...

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:54.280
Right now, I wish I'd never gone 
to the Standard Dimension.

00:18:54.880 --> 00:18:58.540
If I'd stayed in Heartland, Kaito's family...

00:18:58.540 --> 00:19:00.240
All my allies...

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:02.040
Maybe I could have protected them!

00:19:02.040 --> 00:19:03.820
Stop it! Enough, Ute!

00:19:07.860 --> 00:19:09.620
My turn!

00:19:11.700 --> 00:19:12.410
I got it.

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:18.250
I activate The Phantom Knights' 
Rank-Up-Magic Launch from my hand!

00:19:19.320 --> 00:19:22.670
This card lets me use Dark 
Rebellion Xyz Dragon

00:19:22.670 --> 00:19:26.230
as a component, to summon a 
monster of one rank higher.

00:19:26.780 --> 00:19:28.580
From the depths of hell,

00:19:28.580 --> 00:19:32.600
sing the song of souls not yet gone to rest.

00:19:32.600 --> 00:19:34.690
Let it echo through eternity, and appear!

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:37.540
Rank-Up Xyz Change!

00:19:38.160 --> 00:19:43.530
Come out, Rank 5 Dark 
Requiem Xyz Dragon!

00:19:45.360 --> 00:19:48.830
Dark Requiem Xyz Dragon's monster effect!

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:52.300
Once per turn, I can use one Overlay Unit

00:19:52.300 --> 00:19:56.560
to reduce the attack points of one 
monster, Level 5 or below, to 0,

00:19:56.560 --> 00:20:01.400
adding the points reduced to those 
of Dark Requiem Xyz Dragon!

00:20:01.400 --> 00:20:03.840
Requiem Salvation!

00:20:08.520 --> 00:20:09.600
It's no use.

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:12.300
When Dystopia's attack points change,

00:20:12.300 --> 00:20:15.890
its effect activates and destroys your dragon!

00:20:16.160 --> 00:20:22.830
I use one more Overlay Unit on Dark Requiem 
Xyz Dragon to activate its effect!

00:20:22.830 --> 00:20:26.800
I Special Summon Dark Rebellion 
Xyz Dragon from my graveyard,

00:20:26.800 --> 00:20:29.610
and negate Dystopia's effect!

00:20:32.980 --> 00:20:36.540
Summoning a dragon to negate an effect?

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:37.450
Damn...

00:20:37.450 --> 00:20:38.540
Battle!

00:20:39.320 --> 00:20:44.900
I attack Dystopia with Dark 
Requiem Xyz Dragon!

00:20:58.300 --> 00:20:59.770
This ends now!

00:21:00.040 --> 00:21:03.560
Disaster Disobey of Souls' Repose!

00:21:10.960 --> 00:21:12.620
That isn't enough...

00:21:12.620 --> 00:21:14.080
I have no choice.

00:21:14.480 --> 00:21:20.520
To activate its effect, I send Destiny 
HERO — Dynatag to my graveyard!

00:21:20.910 --> 00:21:23.080
When my life is lower than yours,

00:21:23.080 --> 00:21:28.200
I can negate battle damage, and deal 
1000 damage to both players!

00:21:28.200 --> 00:21:28.930
What?

00:21:45.440 --> 00:21:46.460
Hurry!

00:21:46.460 --> 00:21:48.970
Commander, are you injured?!

00:21:49.890 --> 00:21:51.250
Commander?

00:21:52.920 --> 00:21:54.390
Commander!

00:21:54.920 --> 00:21:55.910
Yes.

00:21:56.600 --> 00:21:57.990
His name is...

00:21:59.090 --> 00:22:00.820
Edo Phoenix.

00:22:01.830 --> 00:22:05.000
He's the supreme commander 
of the Academia Army.

00:22:05.360 --> 00:22:07.320
Edo Phoenix...

00:23:51.790 --> 00:23:55.150
Kaito, I understand your sorrow 
at losing your family.

00:23:55.580 --> 00:23:57.900
When I learned that Ruri was kidnapped,

00:23:57.900 --> 00:24:00.810
I wanted to destroy Academia, all by myself.

00:24:00.810 --> 00:24:02.720
What could you understand?

00:24:02.720 --> 00:24:04.940
Get in my way and I'll turn you into a card!

00:24:04.940 --> 00:24:07.260
Let's do it! Duel me!

00:24:07.260 --> 00:24:09.050
Kurosaki! Kaito!

00:24:09.050 --> 00:24:11.050
There's no reason for allies to fight!

00:24:11.660 --> 00:24:15.840
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
The Bonds of Resistance.

00:24:15.840 --> 00:24:17.730
The fun is only getting started!
